WEBVTT

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.060
I'm Russ Michaels and this is Tercet Law.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.520
For almost two decades I've served as a

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:12.860
board president, an executive director,

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.260
or a CEO. And I've always worked.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.640
I tended bar and waited tables to pay

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.880
my way through school and I know what

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:22.900
it means to work hard and to want

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:24.260
to protect what you've worked for.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:27.220
Those tables taught me something I still carry.

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:29.760
People don't come to be impressed.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:31.880
They come to be heard.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:34.580
And that's how I practice law.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:36.980
I lead by serving.

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:39.440
I check my ego at the door.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:42.100
I listen first and then I tell you

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.560
the truth plainly and kindly.

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:48.000
Most families I meet already know they need

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.840
a plan. A will,

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:53.200
maybe a trust, someone named to make decisions

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.760
if they can't. But it feels heavy and

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.840
it's easy to put off until next year.

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:01.620
Here's what I want you to know.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:03.900
If you don't make those choices,

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:06.720
Texas law makes them for you.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:08.760
Who raises your children?

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:10.040
Who keeps the house?

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:13.280
Whether your family spends months in probate court

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:14.680
when they should be together.

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:16.920
So we make it simple.

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:19.520
We sit down. We put everything you own

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:21.320
and everyone you love on one map.

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:23.640
And I tell you what plan fits and

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:26.540
what it costs. The fee is flat and

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:28.020
it's in writing before we start.

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:30.520
And I handle every plan myself.

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:32.840
A good plan isn't about the it.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:36.120
It's about the people you love knowing exactly

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:39.720
what you wanted. There's a door here for

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:42.620
you. Click the link below and set up

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:43.820
a time to talk with me.

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:46.560
Let's put on paper what you've been putting

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:49.680
off. I look forward to hearing from you.
